# source artwork stays out of the repo (66 MB, and it is the master file)
*.pdf
node_modules/
*.ppm
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# The master roster is generated on demand by export_master_xlsx.js. Keeping it
# out means the repo does not carry a second, staler copy of everyone's details
# alongside docs/ — regenerate it instead of committing it.
*.xlsx

# endpoint.json is deliberately NOT ignored: the URL and token end up in the
# public docs/index.html anyway, so hiding the input file would only make the
# build unreproducible from a fresh clone.
